# rather than source. Delete and re-run prebuild instead of editing by hand.
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/

# ---- Personal health data: never published ----
# The owner's own profile and generated plan. They contain medical details
# (condition, medication and dose, body composition) that have no business in a
# public repository. The app works without them; they are inputs, not source.
aboutme.md
yourplan.md

